# The Dockerfile only needs the libmxl pin file, the patches it
# applies to upstream sources and the SBOM fragment script. Everything
# else is
# either irrelevant (Go sources are brought in by downstream consumers)
# or build-time noise that would invalidate the buildkit cache.
*
!.github/libmxl.version
!docker/patches/
!docker/patches/**
!docker/sbom.sh
